# ─── Design documents must never enter this repository's history ───────────────
# This repo is private today and intended to go public. Git history is forever:
# committing a file and deleting it later does NOT remove it — anyone can recover
# it with `git log -p`. Removing it afterwards requires rewriting history and
# force-pushing, which breaks every existing clone and fork.
#
# The design plan, ADRs, and originating specs live in a separate private repo.
# These patterns are a guard against them being copied in by accident.
design_plan.md
master_plan.md
open_questions.md
tokendrop-*-spec.md
docs/architecture/adr/
docs/private/
*.private.md

# ─── Go ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/dropin-miner
/bin/
/dist/
/build/
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
*.test
*.out
coverage.*
*.coverprofile
profile.cov
go.work
go.work.sum

# Fuzzing corpora can capture whatever was fed to the parser. Seed corpora belong
# in testdata/fixtures/ and are reviewed; generated corpora are never committed.
testdata/fuzz/

# ─── Local state — may contain keys, spooled records, or a socket ──────────────
*.key
*.pem
.tokendrop/
*.sock
/spool/
tokendrop.toml
config.local.toml

# ─── Editor / OS ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp

# ─── Additions after review: things that can carry keys, prompts, or heap ──────
# Go fuzz corpora land under any package's testdata/, not just the root one.
**/testdata/fuzz/
.env
.env.*
*.prof
*.pprof
*.trace
*.log
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.jwt
*.jwk
*.jwks

# go build ./scripts/e2e/fixture drops its binary in the repo root
/fixture
